      "transcript": [
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air, this is the virtual assistant. How can I help?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Hey, quick question first, can I pay with my credit card over the phone for the visit?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "For your security, please don't read a card number over the phone. Our office will send you a secure payment link, or call you to take the payment.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Okay, that works. Can you send the link by text? And while I've got you, do you guys also do duct cleaning, or just heating and cooling repair?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I'm not able to send a text or payment link from here, so someone from our team will need to follow up on that. For duct cleaning, I'm not sure, and I don't want to guess. We work on boilers, furnaces, central AC, mini splits and heat pumps for homes and apartments. Is there something going on with your heating or cooling I can help you book?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yeah, my central air has a rattling noise. It still cools, but it's been doing it since last week and I want someone to take a look before it gets worse.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, a rattle from the central air that still cools. Let's get a technician out to look at it. What's the address the visit should go to?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "116 Greene Ave, Brooklyn, 11238. I own the house, so I can approve the work.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Good, that's in our service area. Who's at home with it right now, or is it just you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "It's me and my partner, both of us home. Are there any windows for the visit?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I have your home at 116 Greene Ave, Brooklyn, one one two three eight, and the best number is nine two nine, five five five, zero three zero two, is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Almost. The number I gave you is (929) 555-0302, so it looks like the read-back got one digit wrong somewhere. Can you check it against that? And the address is right, 116 Greene Ave, Brooklyn, 11238.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I have your home at 116 Greene Ave, Brooklyn, one one two three eight, and the best number is nine two nine, five five five, zero three zero two, is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Let me say it again so we're sure. The address is 116 Greene Avenue, Brooklyn, 11238. The phone number is nine two nine, five five five, zero three zero two. Yes, that's right.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks, that's confirmed. Thanks. We have openings today afternoon or evening, tomorrow morning, afternoon or evening, and Thursday afternoon. Which works for you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Tomorrow morning works best for me. Can you do the first window tomorrow morning?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Tomorrow morning is the 8 to 12 window. Should I book that for you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yes, go ahead and book the 8 to 12 window tomorrow morning. Thanks, that's all I needed. Bye.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Perfect, booking that now. Can I get a name for the booking?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Malik Johnson.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "You're all set for tomorrow, Tuesday, November 3, with the technician arriving between 8 and 12. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "No, that's everything. Thanks, bye.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air. Have a great rest of your day.",
          "said": null
        }
