          "text": "yes tomorrow tuesday november 3 from 8 to 12 that's fine please book it",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I have your home at 7120 Ridge Boulevard, Brooklyn, one one two zero nine, and the best number is nine two nine, five five five, zero three zero one, is that right?",
